        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "do hereby authorize and instruct Michigan Consolidated Gas Company (hereinafter referred to as the \"Company\") to deduct the sum of ___ Dollars ($___) from the wages that will be payable to me on the first payday of the month in which the Company receives this authorization, said sum being the initiation fee of Gas Workers Local #80, Service Employees International Union, AFL-CIO, (hereinafter referred to as the \"Union\").",
